    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "datasource",
        "uid": "-- Dashboard --"
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "code": { "language": "markdown", "showLineNumbers": false, "showMiniMap": false },
        "content": "### Run metadata\nSet this dashboard's time range to the run's `startedAtUtc`/`endedAtUtc` (see `evidence/aws-load-tests/<run-id>/metadata.json`). SLO version comes from `freeze-metadata.json` after D-006 approval — it is not a live metric. Run ID, scenario, and platform are carried only by the **B-01 run events** Annotation (never a metric label). This dashboard does not fetch or display those files directly; the operator cross-references them manually per aws-load-test-handoff/plans/04_GRAFANA_DASHBOARD_PLAN.md.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "13.1.0",
      "title": "Run metadata / time range / SLO version",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
